-- Tests of circular תשפ"ד/1 against the Hours of Work and Rest Law (MMS-678; the
-- card trip-units-overtime). It prints the reform's table of §40(ב) of the
-- completion agreement to the owners' teachers: 4.5 units for a day out
-- ending between 21:00 and 24:00 and 6.5 for a night away, each 0.7% of the
-- monthly combined salary of a full position. Measured against what the law
-- asks for the worked days (l4/lib/escort-day.l4), at the bound most
-- generous to the employer (convention instruments.regular-hour-wage): the
-- units fall short on the day out to 23:00, and on the night away even
-- with the night left out. The circular is the status quo the card is
-- graded by (the corpus repo's decision 17).

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `escort-day`
IMPORT `2023-24_tashpad_01`

§ `בדיקות חוזר תשפ"ד/1 מול חוק שעות עבודה ומנוחה`

-- What a number of units pays, in hours of a month of 195: the circular's
-- own rule for a unit's value, on a month of one shekel an hour.
GIVEN units IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `regular hours circular תשפ"ד/1's units pay, at most` units IS
    `the escort bonus` units `the most hours a month of section 3's longest week holds`

`circular תשפ"ד/1's units pay less than the law asks for a day out to 23:00 and for a night away` MEANS
        `the instrument pays less than the Hours of Work and Rest Law asks`
            (`regular hours section 16 asks for an escort day` 8 23)
            (`regular hours circular תשפ"ד/1's units pay, at most` (`escort units for an end at` 23))
    AND `the instrument pays less than the Hours of Work and Rest Law asks`
            (`regular hours section 16 asks for the worked night away` FALSE)
            (`regular hours circular תשפ"ד/1's units pay, at most` (`the units of an activity with an overnight stay`))
#ASSERT `circular תשפ"ד/1's units pay less than the law asks for a day out to 23:00 and for a night away`

#ASSERT `regular hours circular תשפ"ד/1's units pay, at most` (`escort units for an end at` 23) EQUALS 6.1425
#ASSERT `regular hours circular תשפ"ד/1's units pay, at most` (`the units of an activity with an overnight stay`) EQUALS 8.8725
